---
source: crates/dsql-core/tests/it/completions.rs
expression: "format!(\"singular body:\\n{singular}\\n\\nclause:\\n{clause}\\n\\naggregate body:\\n{aggregate}\")"
---
singular body:
Column created_at (timestamptz)
Column email (text)
Column id (uuid)
Column name (text)
Relation posts (relation to public.posts via user_id)

clause:
Column created_at (timestamptz)
Column email (text)
Column id (uuid)
Column name (text)
Scope . (current scope)
Scope .. (parent scope)
Scope ~ (root scope)
Keyword exists
Keyword in
Keyword is
Keyword not

aggregate body:
Keyword avg (aggregate function)
Keyword count (aggregate function)
Keyword exists (aggregate function)
Keyword max (aggregate function)
Keyword min (aggregate function)
Keyword sum (aggregate function)
